Subject: [PATCH 3/3] cc33xx: fix cc33xx_op_*

Signed-off-by: Robert Nelson <robertcnelson@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/net/wireless/ti/cc33xx/main.c | 8 +++++---
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/ti/cc33xx/main.c b/drivers/net/wireless/ti/cc33xx/main.c
index b6596a74f004..3e5ac41e0cdd 100644
